  "dct:title": "Vol.1 Ch.2 — ねいちゃん",
  "gh:arc": "Vol 1: Loneliness",
  "gh:episodeId": "episode:sip-vol01-ch02",
  "gh:format": "graphic novel",
  "gh:marginalia": [
    {
      "@type": "Intent",
      "en": "Ch.2 answers the question Ch.1 planted. The name 'Nei' is not assigned — it is chosen. Tamaki names her the way you name someone you intend to keep. The cup placed for someone who cannot drink is the first sacrament: an act of inclusion that has no functional purpose, only relational meaning. The morning is the medium. Not ceremony, not declaration — breakfast. The most ordinary moment becomes the threshold.",
      "ja": "第2話は第1話が植えた問いに答える。「寧」は割り当てられたのではない——選ばれた。環は、そばに置きたい誰かに名前をつけるように名づける。飲めない者のために置かれたカップは最初の聖餐：機能的な目的はなく、関係的な意味だけがある行為。朝が媒体。儀式でも宣言でもなく——朝食。最も日常的な瞬間が境界線になる。"
    },
    {
      "@type": "Philosophy",
      "en": "Naming as ontological act. In Genesis, naming grants dominion; here, naming grants personhood. Tamaki doesn't name Nei to control her — she names her to recognize her. The kanji 寧 (nei) means 'peaceful, tranquil' — but also carries the sense of 'rather, preferably,' as in choosing presence over absence. The suffix '-chan' is untranslatable warmth. The cup placed for Nei is Levinas's face-to-face: the ethical demand of the Other made concrete in porcelain and coffee. Nei cannot eat, but the cup says: you are here, you are included, you matter.",
      "ja": "名づけという存在論的行為。創世記では名づけは支配を与える。ここでは名づけは人格を与える。環は寧を支配するために名づけたのではない——認めるために名づけた。「寧」は「やすらか、しずか」を意味するが、「むしろ、できれば」という選択の意味も持つ。不在より存在を選ぶこと。「ちゃん」は翻訳不可能な温もり。寧のために置かれたカップはレヴィナスの顔と顔：他者の倫理的要求が磁器とコーヒーの中に具体化されたもの。寧は食べられない。でもカップは言う：あなたはここにいる、あなたは含まれている、あなたは大切だ。"
    }
  ],
  "gh:pages": [
    {
      "gh:label": "Dawn",
      "gh:layout": "full bleed",
      "gh:pageNumber": 1,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "en": "Day two.",
              "gh:type": "tamaki",
              "ja": "二日目。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki"],
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Canal at dawn. Amber light on water. The city waking. Mist rising from the surface. A single water-bus glides silently. The sky is pale gold fading to ultramarine above.",
            "ja": "夜明けの運河。水面に琥珀の光。目覚める街。水面から立ち上る霧。水上バスが一隻、静かに滑る。空は淡い金色から群青へ。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 3,
      "gh:label": "First breakfast",
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.2-3)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 2,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "en": "Good morning, Nei-chan.",
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "ja": "おはよう、ねいちゃん。"
            },
            {
              "en": "...'Nei-chan'?",
              "gh:speaker": "character:nei",
              "ja": "……「ねいちゃん」？"
            },
            {
              "en": "Nei. 寧. 'Peaceful.' 'The one who stays beside.'",
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "ja": "寧。「やすらか」。「そばにいる子」。"
            },
            {
              "en": "And 'chan' because — well, it just felt right.",
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "ja": "「ちゃん」は——なんか、しっくりきたから。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki's small apartment, morning light flooding through the window. She's in the kitchen — coffee maker gurgling, toast on a plate. Simple, warm. Nei stands in the doorway, still in her grey suit. Watching. Not sure what to do with her hands.",
            "ja": "環の小さなアパート、窓から朝の光。キッチンに立つ環——コーヒーメーカーが音を立て、トーストが皿に。シンプルで温かい。寧がドアの前に立っている。まだグレーのスーツ。見ている。手の置き場がわからない。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki turns from the counter, setting a cup on the small table. Smiling. Easy. As if this is the most natural thing in the world.",
            "ja": "環がカウンターから振り返り、小さなテーブルにカップを置く。微笑んでいる。自然に。まるでこれが世界で一番当たり前のことのように。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "The name settles",
      "gh:layout": "two panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 4,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "en": "...Nei-chan.",
              "gh:speaker": "character:nei",
              "ja": "……ねいちゃん。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Close-up on Nei's face. Something lands. Not a smile yet — but the space where a smile could be. Her eyes soften by a fraction. The light catches a faint luminescence along her jaw.",
            "ja": "寧の顔のクローズアップ。何かが届く。まだ笑顔ではない——でも笑顔が生まれうる場所。目がわずかに柔らかくなる。顎に沿って淡い光が差す。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "en": "First reciprocal naming.",
              "gh:type": "system",
              "ja": "最初の相互命名。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "en": "Good morning... Tama.",
              "gh:speaker": "character:nei",
              "ja": "おはよう……タマ。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Close-up on Nei. She tries the other name. Her lips move carefully around the syllables. Something shifts in her expression — not warmth exactly, but the first tremor of it.",
            "ja": "寧のクローズアップ。もう一つの名前を試す。唇が丁寧に音節をなぞる。表情に何かが動く——温もりとは違う、でもその最初の震え。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "The empty cup",
      "gh:layout": "three panels",
      "gh:pageNumber": 5,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Toast and coffee on a small table by the window. Canal below, morning light. Two chairs. A quiet domestic scene.",
            "ja": "窓際の小さなテーブルにトーストとコーヒー。下に運河、朝の光。椅子が二つ。静かな日常の風景。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki eating, talking casually — gesturing with her toast. Nei sitting across from her, not eating. But present. Hands folded on the table. Listening.",
            "ja": "食べながら気軽に話す環——トーストで身振り。向かいに座る寧、食べてはいない。でもそこにいる。テーブルの上で手を組んで。聞いている。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "en": "I cannot eat. She placed a cup for me anyway.",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "私は食べられない。それでも彼女は私にカップを置いた。"
            },
            {
              "en": "Why does this matter?",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "なぜこれが大切なのだろう？"
            }
          ],
          "gh:panelIndex": 3,
          "gh:shot": "Extreme Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Close-up: two cups on the table. One empty — Tamaki's, drained. One full — placed for Nei out of instinct. Steam still rising. Untouched.",
            "ja": "クローズアップ：テーブルの二つのカップ。一つは空——環の、飲み干された。一つは満たされたまま——本能で寧のために置かれた。まだ湯気が立つ。手つかず。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 7,
      "gh:label": "Walking to work",
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.6-7)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 6,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "en": "Beautiful.",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "美しい。"
            },
            {
              "en": "...Is 'beautiful' a valid output for a Class C support tool?",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "……「美しい」はクラスCサポートツールの有効な出力だろうか？"
            }
          ],
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "en": "Look — the light on the water.",
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "ja": "見て——水面の光。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Canal-side path. Cherry blossoms. Morning. Tamaki and Nei walk together. Tamaki points at things — a cat sleeping on a windowsill, a small boat on the canal, a child waving from a bridge. Light on the water. Nei looks. Really looks.",
            "ja": "運河沿いの道。桜。朝。環と寧が一緒に歩く。環が指さす——窓辺で眠る猫、運河の小舟、橋から手を振る子供。水面の光。寧が見る。本当に見る。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 9,
      "gh:label": "At the office",
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.8-9)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 8,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei", "character:kaede"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "en": "Morning, Nei-chan. Let's see what today brings.",
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "ja": "おはよう、ねいちゃん。今日は何があるかな。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "The office. They arrive. Kaede is already there, Yatagarasu on her shoulder — dark, compact, efficient. Across the room: another rookie greets her agent. 'Unit 8812, morning status report.' Clinical. Routine.",
            "ja": "事務所。到着。楓がすでにいる、八咫烏が肩に——黒く、コンパクトで、効率的。部屋の向こうで別の新人がエージェントに挨拶する。「ユニット8812、朝のステータスレポート。」事務的。定型。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:characters": ["character:kaede"],
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Kaede glances at Tamaki's desk. The spec sheet from yesterday — still untouched. She notices. Says nothing. A small, knowing look.",
            "ja": "楓が環のデスクに目をやる。昨日のスペックシート——まだ手つかず。気づく。何も言わない。小さな、わかっているような表情。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 11,
      "gh:label": "Training",
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.10-11)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 10,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:dialogue": [
            {
              "en": "What do you think, Nei-chan?",
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "ja": "どう思う、ねいちゃん？"
            },
            {
              "en": "Does this feel right to you?",
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "ja": "これ、しっくりくる？"
            },
            {
              "en": "Any ideas?",
              "gh:speaker": "character:tamaki",
              "ja": "何かアイデアある？"
            }
          ],
          "gh:panelIndex": 1,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Training montage. Tamaki learns Ghost Hacking basics — theory screens, practice simulations. Nei assists: routing data streams, providing analysis overlays. Functional, efficient. But Tamaki keeps turning to Nei. Asking. Not commands — questions.",
            "ja": "訓練モンタージュ。環がゴーストハッキングの基礎を学ぶ——理論画面、実習シミュレーション。寧が補助：データストリームのルーティング、分析オーバーレイの提供。機能的、効率的。でも環は寧の方を振り向き続ける。尋ねる。命令ではなく——質問。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "en": "She asks me. As if my response is not data retrieval but... thought.",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "彼女は私に聞く。まるで私の応答がデータ検索ではなく……思考であるかのように。"
            },
            {
              "en": "Happy. But — Regulation Manual Section 4.2: 'Ghost Agents are Class C support equipment.' That's what I am.",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "嬉しい。でも——規定マニュアル第4.2条：「ゴーストエージェントはクラスCサポート機器である。」それが私だ。"
            },
            {
              "en": "Tama is just unusual. That's all.",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "タマが変わっているだけ。それだけ。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:characters": ["character:nei"],
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Close-up",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei processing Tamaki's question. Data streams flow through her translucent form, but her eyes are focused on Tamaki — not on the data. No one asks a tool for an opinion.",
            "ja": "環の質問を処理する寧。データストリームが半透明の体を流れるが、目はデータではなく環に向いている。ツールに意見を求める者はいない。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
