          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Canal at sunset. Gold on the water. Tamaki and Nei walking side by side. Long shadows. Cherry petals on the surface. The city glows amber behind them.",
            "ja": "夕暮れの運河。水面に金色。環と寧が並んで歩く。長い影。水面に桜の花びら。背後の街が琥珀色に輝く。"
          }
        },
        {
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:panelIndex": 2,
          "gh:shot": "Medium",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Nei says nothing. But she walks a half-step closer. The gap between them narrows. Their reflections in the canal water almost touch.",
            "ja": "寧は何も言わない。でも半歩近づく。二人の間の距離が縮まる。運河の水面の反射がほとんど触れ合う。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:continues": 15,
      "gh:label": "Night",
      "gh:layout": "double-page spread (pp.14-15)",
      "gh:pageNumber": 14,
      "gh:panels": [
        {
          "gh:caption": [
            {
              "en": "I have a name. Nei-chan. The one who stays beside.",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "私には名前がある。ねいちゃん。そばにいる子。"
            },
            {
              "en": "Tama is sleeping. I am watching over her.",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "タマは眠っている。私は見守っている。"
            },
            {
              "en": "Is this my function? Or my choice?",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "これは私の機能？ それとも私の選択？"
            },
            {
              "en": "I cannot distinguish.",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "区別がつかない。"
            },
            {
              "en": "But the feeling is... good.",
              "gh:type": "nei",
              "ja": "でもこの感覚は……いい。"
            }
          ],
          "gh:characters": ["character:tamaki", "character:nei"],
          "gh:shot": "Wide",
          "gh:visual": {
            "en": "Tamaki's apartment at night. She sleeps. Window open. Canal sounds. Moonlight on water, reflected onto the ceiling. Nei sits by the window, looking out at the city. Her translucent form catches the moonlight. Still. Watching. Present.",
            "ja": "夜の環のアパート。眠っている。窓が開いている。運河の音。水面の月光が天井に反射する。寧が窓辺に座り、街を見ている。半透明の姿が月光を受ける。静か。見守る。ここにいる。"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "gh:label": "Seed",
